%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-randomint (関数ページ)
実行ごとに変わる部分は %%% mask / %%% env / %%% variants で扱う (docs/fixtures.md)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{ price: randomInt(1000) }
%%% mask
"price": (\d+)
%%% output application/json
{
  "price": 642
}
